    user_response: "User: do this in next js\nmobile first \n\n> Build a mobile-first React web app called **QuickReply** \342\200\224 a snippet manager for solopreneurs and online sellers who answer repetitive DMs on WhatsApp, Instagram, and email.\n>\n> **Design language:** Coral red (`#FF4D3D`) as the primary accent. White cards on a light gray background (`#F7F7FB`). Rounded corners everywhere (12\342\200\22316px). Nunito + Nunito Sans from Google Fonts. Feels like a native iOS app. Max width 430px centered.\n>\n> **Layout structure:**\n> - Sticky header with app name \"QuickReply\" (coral accent on \"Reply\"), a search input, and horizontal scrollable pill tabs for category filtering: All, Shipping, Returns, Pricing, General \342\200\224 each showing a count badge\n> - Scrollable snippet card list below\n> - Floating coral FAB button (56px circle, bottom right) to add new snippets\n>\n> **Snippet cards:**\n> - White card with 16px border radius, subtle shadow\n> - Top row: emoji icon + bold title + coral category pill badge\n> - Body text collapsed to ~72 chars by default; tap card to expand full text\n> - Bottom row: Edit button, Delete button (coral), and a coral Copy button (pill shape)\n> - Copy button animates to green with a checkmark on success; card flashes green briefly\n> - Cards animate in with a staggered slideUp on first render\n>\n> **Add/Edit flow:**\n> - Tapping FAB or Edit opens a bottom sheet that slides up from the bottom (not a modal popup)\n> - Bottom sheet has: drag handle, title input, category selector (pill buttons, coral when active), textarea for message body, and a Save button (coral, disabled-styled when fields are empty)\n> - Tapping the backdrop closes the sheet with a slide-down animation\n>\n> **Data:**\n> - Store snippets in React state (no backend needed)\n> - Preload 8 sample snippets across the 4 categories\n> - Each snippet: `{ id, category, title, body }`\n>\n> **Feedback:**\n> - Dark toast notification slides up from above the FAB when copying, saving, or deleting\n>\n> **Tech:** Single `.jsx` file. React with hooks only. No external UI libraries. Inline styles throughout. Google Fonts via a `<link>` tag injected in a `useEffect`..\nModel: **Defining the Objective**\n\nI\'m solidifying the core objective: a mobile-first React web app, dubbed QuickReply, built with Next.js. My immediate focus is on a single-file solution, considering either the Page router or App router. I\'m leaning toward a page component that can be easily integrated into a Next.js route.\n\n\n**Refining the Approach**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a single, clean `.jsx` page component that I can directly integrate into Next.js. The emphasis is on highly refined styling using inline styles exclusively, avoiding external CSS files or Tailwind for self-containment. Though media queries are tricky, I plan to leverage helper style objects and CSS variables. I\'m exploring adding a small `<style>` tag, if needed, for more complex animations or hover states, though I expect inline styling to cover most of it.\n\n\n**Implementing the Styles**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the styling details. My current focus is implementing keyframe animations, scrollbar hiding, and incorporating system-level styles, all through inline style objects. The mobile-first design will feature a max width of 430px centered, with a mock iOS status bar. The core design language includes coral red accents and white cards on a light gray background, rounded corners, and Nunito fonts. I\'ll inject the fonts using a `<link>` tag within a `useEffect`. The layout starts with the status bar, a sticky header with the app name, search input, and horizontal scrollable pill tabs.\n\n\n**Detailing the UI Components**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the UI components for QuickReply. I\'ve broken down each element: scrollable list of snippet cards, the FAB (floating action button), and the add/edit flow via a bottom sheet that slides up. Each snippet card will display an emoji, a bold title, and a coral-colored category pill. The body collapses, expanding on tap. Editing is done through a bottom sheet with inputs and a save button. I will start with React state, preloaded with 8 sample snippets.\n\n\n**Adding Notifications**\n\nI\'m now integrating dark toast notifications that slide up from above the FAB to provide feedback on actions like copying, saving, and deleting snippets. I\'m focusing on the visual and UX aspects. My next step will be to think about the component structure using the Next.js App Router, using a client component for direct manipulation. I am planning on mock-up of the phone-framed structure, for the status bar, and other design elements.\n\n\n**Expanding the Snippets**\n\nI am now expanding the initial set of predefined snippet cards to include a wider range of customer service inquiries. I have incorporated responses for order tracking, international shipping, return policies, damaged items, discount codes, wholesale rates, and general business hours, adding more versatility. Each snippet card is being crafted with an emoji, clear title, and relevant category to help quickly locate the needed response.\n\n\n**Adding the Sample Snippets**\n\nI\'m now populating the application with some sample responses, and including additional \"thank you\" greetings. I am expanding and organizing the responses with a bit more clarity and detail. I am working towards a more complete set of sample replies to customer service queries.\n\n\n\n**Refining the Styles**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the base styles and animations within the application. I have incorporated several keyframe animations for toast notifications and other UI elements. I have also added rules to hide scrollbars for a cleaner look and feel, and am now integrating general system styles and initial values for common UI components. I\'ve also added pulse animation for green elements.\n\n\n**Designing the Status Bar**\n\nI\'m now crafting the mock iOS status bar component, aiming for authenticity. I\'m focusing on dynamic time display using a `useState` hook and `useEffect` for real-time updates. The component will render a compact status bar, mirroring system details, for a native feel.\n\n**State Management Considerations**\n\nI\'ve outlined my state management strategy: `snippets` will hold the preloaded array, `searchQuery` is a string for filtering, `selectedCategory` will track the currently active category, and `editingSnippet` will hold the object being modified. This gives me a clear direction for data handling.\n\n\n**Defining Component State**\n\nI\'m now defining the component state, including `isBottomSheetOpen`, the `toast` object, and `copiedSnippetId`. I\'m also planning the filter system, including category and search query matching. For the slide-up animation I will use staggered delays. The bottom sheet will be a container with position fixed or absolute, contained perfectly within the phone mockup.\n\n\n**Implementing the Sheet**\n\nI\'m now fully focused on the bottom sheet implementation, and after experimenting, I\'ve found that absolute positioning within the 430px container is the best approach. It will provide perfect integration with the phone mockup, and give me more control. I need to define state variables for form data: title, category, and body, and initialize with default values. The \"Save\" button is disabled until both title and body are populated. I also have the notification toast just above the FAB.\n\n\n**Adding Copy Functionality**\n\nI\'m now implementing the copy logic. I\'m focusing on `navigator.clipboard.writeText(body)` functionality, tracking `copiedSnippetId`, and displaying success toasts. The success toast will be set with a \"Snippet copied to clipboard!\" message, which will clear after 2 seconds. I\'m also planning to incorporate a visual flash animation on the snippet card upon successful copy. I\'m using an array, or set, for expanded snippet IDs.\n\n\n**Defining Card Expansion**\n\nI\'m now refining the snippet card expansion logic. I\'ve switched from a single active index to a toggle set, `expandedCardIds`, for expanded cards. Tapping toggles expansion, and if the card ID is in `expandedCardIds`, it shows the full body; otherwise, it displays a truncated version. I\'ll add visual cues for collapsed state, and incorporate the appropriate colors.\n\nI\'m also setting colors and fonts. I\'m using Nunito and Nunito Sans, with primary color `#FF4D3D`, and various gray shades for the background, text, and borders, for a refined aesthetic.\n\n\n**Crafting the FAB**\n\nI\'m now laser-focused on implementing the FAB and designing the status bar icons. I\'m building simple SVG icons for battery, signal, and Wi-Fi to create a high-fidelity look. The FAB will be fixed within the mockup, using absolute positioning and a circular shape with a shadow for depth, and active scaling upon touch. I\'m committed to clear structure and semantic HTML for React code.\n\n\n**Adding Category Filtering**\n\nI\'m now integrating the category filter system with a horizontal row of buttons, including accurate count badges for each category: \"All,\" \"Shipping,\" \"Returns,\" \"Pricing,\" and \"General.\" I\'m ensuring exact category matching with a dedicated array. I\'ll need to use state for the sheet open, transitioning styling using inline transitions and a semi-transparent backdrop. I plan to use transitions for the backdrop.\n\n\n**Refining the Transitions**\n\nI\'m now refining the transitions, focusing on smooth and instant enter/exit animations for both the bottom sheet and toast notifications, based on their respective state variables. The bottom sheet utilizes `translateY` and `opacity` to slide in and out seamlessly, while the toast employs a similar strategy with `bottom` and `opacity`. The key to elegant transitions is their instant responsiveness and handling both enter/exit states. I will use a helper function to trigger the toast.\n\n\n**Enhancing Icon Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating optimized SVG icons directly into the UI for all essential buttons, including Edit, Delete, Plus, and Search, to improve performance. I am also working on the category selector using horizontal pills, and verifying that the key layout elements align perfectly.\n\n\n**Finalizing the Snippet Content**\n\nI\'m finalizing the snippet content and ensuring each card starts with a fitting emoji representing the category. I am now hardcoding those emojis in a helper, keeping them in the object, and creating some more professional templates. Each snippet reflects realistic solopreneur needs.\n\n\n**Calculating the Counts**\n\nI\'m now calculating the category count badges dynamically. I\'ve implemented logic to show accurate counts for \"All,\" \"Shipping,\" \"Returns,\" \"Pricing,\" and \"General\" based on filtered snippets, ensuring a data-driven approach to the UI.\n\n\n\n**Defining the Viewport**\n\nI\'m now implementing viewport height and centering with a `.device-container` class. For mobile, it\'s 100vh or 100dvh, with no shadow, and on desktop, it\'s capped at 430px with a shadow, for a clean app-like preview. The styling is now mobile first.\n\n\n**Optimizing Component Code**\n\nI\'m now focusing on ensuring clean, well-commented code. I\'m writing error-handling for `navigator.clipboard`, with fallback, and refining animations for copy feedback and save button states. I\'m building a \'use client\' component to work with a Next.js Page.\n\n\n\nModel: Here is a self-contained, mobile-first Next.js Page component (`page.jsx` or `index.jsx`) for **QuickReply** [1]. It is designed with standard React hooks, elegant SVG icons, micro-animations, and responsive shell optimization. \n\nTo prevent hydration mismatch issues common in Next.js SSR, a mounted state check is included for client-side calculations (such as the simulated status bar clock) [1].\n\n### Implementation\n\n```jsx\n\'use client\';\n\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useRef, useMemo } from \'react\';\n\n// Preloaded sample snippets data\nconst INITIAL_SNIPPETS = [\n  {\n    id: 1,\n    category: \'Shipping\',\n    title: \'Order Tracking Link\',\n    body: \'Hey there! \360\237\223\246 Your order is on its way. You can track its progress here: https://track.quickreply.io/order-status\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 2,\n    category: \'Shipping\',\n    title: \'International Shipping Policy\',\n    body: \'Yes, we ship globally! \360\237\214\215 International delivery usually takes between 7 to 14 business days depending on customs.\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 3,\n    category: \'Returns\',\n    title: \'30-Day Policy Details\',\n    body: \'We offer a 30-day return policy! \360\237\224\204 Items must be in their original packaging. Start your return at returns.quickreply.io\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 4,\n    category: \'Returns\',\n    title: \'Damaged Items Procedure\',\n    body: \'I am so sorry to hear that! \360\237\245\272 Please share your order number along with a photo of the damaged item so we can ship a replacement.\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 5,\n    category: \'Pricing\',\n    title: \'First Order Discount\',\n    body: \'Welcome aboard! \360\237\216\211 You can use the promo code \"WELCOME10\" at checkout to get an extra 10% discount on your first purchase.\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 6,\n    category: \'Pricing\',\n    title: \'Bulk Pricing Inquiry\',\n    body: \'Thanks for reaching out! \360\237\222\274 We offer discounts for wholesale orders of 50 units or more. Please email wholesale@quickreply.io\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 7,\n    category: \'General\',\n    title: \'Standard Business Hours\',\n    body: \'Our support hours are Mon-Fri, 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM EST. \360\237\225\222 We will do our absolute best to get back to you within 2 hours.\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 8,\n    category: \'General\',\n    title: \'Closing Appreciation\',\n    body: \'Thank you for choosing us today! \360\237\231\214 Let me know if you need help with anything else. Have a fantastic rest of your day!\'\n  }\n];\n\nconst CATEGORIES = [\'All\', \'Shipping\', \'Returns\', \'Pricing\', \'General\'];\n\nexport default function QuickReply() {\n  const [snippets, setSnippets] = useState(INITIAL_SNIPPETS);\n  const [selectedCategory, setSelectedCategory] = useState(\'All\');\n  const [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState(\'\');\n  \n  // UI states\n  const [mounted, setMounted] = useState(false);\n  const [time, setTime] = useState(\'09:41\');\n  const [expandedCards, setExpandedCards] = useState(new Set());\n  const [copiedSnippetId, setCopiedSnippetId] = useState(null);\n  \n  // Bottom Sheet States\n  const [isBottomSheetOpen, setIsBottomSheetOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [editingSnippet, setEditingSnippet] = useState(null);\n  const [formTitle, setFormTitle] = useState(\'\');\n  const [formCategory, setFormCategory] = useState(\'General\');\n  const [formBody, setFormBody] = useState(\'\');\n  \n  // Toast Notification State\n  const [toast, setToast] = useState({ visible: false, message: \'\' });\n  const toastTimeoutRef = useRef(null);\n\n  // Injects Google Fonts via link tag and updates simulated device clock\n  useEffect(() => {\n    setMounted(true);\n    \n    // Inject Fonts\n    const link = document.createElement(\'link\');\n    link.rel = \'stylesheet\';\n    link.href = \'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Nunito+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap\';\n    document.head.appendChild(link);\n\n    // Update Simulated clock\n    const updateTime = () => {\n      const now = new Date();\n      const hours = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, \'0\');\n      const minutes = String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, \'0\');\n      setTime(`${hours}:${minutes}`);\n    };\n    updateTime();\n    const clockInterval = setInterval(updateTime, 60000);\n\n    return () => {\n      document.head.removeChild(link);\n      clearInterval(clockInterval);\n      if (toastTimeoutRef.current) clearTimeout(toastTimeoutRef.current);\n    };\n  }, []);\n\n  // Filter snippets based on Category + Search Term\n  const filteredSnippets = useMemo(() => {\n    return snippets.filter((snippet) => {\n      const matchesCategory = selectedCategory === \'All\' || snippet.category === selectedCategory;\n      const matchesSearch = \n        snippet.title.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery.toLowerCase()) ||\n        snippet.body.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery.toLowerCase());\n      return matchesCategory && matchesSearch;\n    });\n  }, [snippets, selectedCategory, searchQuery]);\n\n  // Compute item counts for the category tabs\n  const categoryCounts = useMemo(() => {\n    const counts = { All: snippets.length };\n    CATEGORIES.slice(1).forEach(cat => {\n      counts[cat] = snippets.filter(s => s.category === cat).length;\n    });\n    return counts;\n  }, [snippets]);\n\n  // Trigger Toast feedback\n  const triggerToast = (message) => {\n    if (toastTimeoutRef.current) clearTimeout(toastTimeoutRef.current);\n    setToast({ visible: true, message });\n    toastTimeoutRef.current = setTimeout(() => {\n      setToast({ visible: false, message: \'\' });\n    }, 2500);\n  };\n\n  // Expand or collapse card text body\n  const toggleCardExpansion = (id) => {\n    const next = new Set(expandedCards);\n    if (next.has(id)) {\n      next.delete(id);\n    } else {\n      next.add(id);\n    }\n    setExpandedCards(next);\n  };\n\n  // Copy to clipboard with success state\n  const handleCopyText = async (e, id, text) => {\n    e.stopPropagation(); // Avoid expanding/collapsing on copy button tap\n    try {\n      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);\n      setCopiedSnippetId(id);\n      triggerToast(\'Copied to clipboard!\');\n      \n      // Reset card visual state\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        setCopiedSnippetId(null);\n      }, 1500);\n    } catch (err) {\n      triggerToast(\'Failed to copy text.\');\n    }\n  };\n\n  // Open bottom sheet for fresh layout\n  const handleOpenAdd = () => {\n    setEditingSnippet(null);\n    setFormTitle(\'\');\n    setFormCategory(\'General\');\n    setFormBody(\'\');\n    setIsBottomSheetOpen(true);\n  };\n\n  // Open bottom sheet populated with existing details\n  const handleOpenEdit = (e, snippet) => {\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    setEditingSnippet(snippet);\n    setFormTitle(snippet.title);\n    setFormCategory(snippet.category);\n    setFormBody(snippet.body);\n    setIsBottomSheetOpen(true);\n  };\n\n  // Handle Form Submission\n  const handleSave = (e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) return;\n\n    if (editingSnippet) {\n      // Edit logic\n      setSnippets(prev => prev.map(s => s.id === editingSnippet.id ? {\n        ...s,\n        title: formTitle.trim(),\n        category: formCategory,\n        body: formBody.trim()\n      } : s));\n      triggerToast(\'Snippet updated successfully\');\n    } else {\n      // Add logic\n      const newSnippet = {\n        id: Date.now(),\n        title: formTitle.trim(),\n        category: formCategory,\n        body: formBody.trim()\n      };\n      setSnippets(prev => [newSnippet, ...prev]);\n      triggerToast(\'New snippet saved\');\n    }\n    setIsBottomSheetOpen(false);\n  };\n\n  // Delete Action\n  const handleDelete = (e, id) => {\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    setSnippets(prev => prev.filter(s => s.id !== id));\n    triggerToast(\'Snippet deleted\');\n  };\n\n  const getCategoryEmoji = (category) => {\n    switch (category) {\n      case \'Shipping\': return \'\360\237\223\246\';\n      case \'Returns\': return \'\360\237\224\204\';\n      case \'Pricing\': return \'\360\237\222\260\';\n      case \'General\': return \'\360\237\222\254\';\n      default: return \'\360\237\223\235\';\n    }\n  };\n\n  // Return SSR-friendly initial wrapper\n  if (!mounted) {\n    return (\n      <div style={{ display: \'flex\', justifyContent: \'center\', alignItems: \'center\', minHeight: \'100vh\', background: \'#e1e1e6\' }}>\n        <p style={{ fontFamily: \'sans-serif\', color: \'#6B7280\' }}>Loading QuickReply...</p>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"app-viewport\">\n      <style dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: `\n        body {\n          margin: 0;\n          padding: 0;\n          background-color: #E2E8F0;\n          font-family: \'Nunito\', \'Nunito Sans\', sans-serif;\n          -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n          display: flex;\n          justify-content: center;\n          align-items: center;\n          min-height: 100vh;\n        }\n\n        .app-viewport {\n          width: 100%;\n          max-width: 430px;\n          height: 100vh;\n          max-height: 932px; /* standard iPhone Pro Max aspect height */\n          background-color: #F7F7FB;\n          position: relative;\n          display: flex;\n          flex-direction: column;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 430px) {\n          .app-viewport {\n            max-height: 100vh;\n            border-radius: 0;\n            box-shadow: none;\n          }\n        }\n\n        /* Animations */\n        @keyframes slideUpIn {\n          from {\n            transform: translateY(24px);\n            opacity: 0;\n          }\n          to {\n            transform: translateY(0);\n            opacity: 1;\n          }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulseSuccess {\n          0% { background-color: #ffffff; }\n          30% { background-color: #ECFDF5; border-color: #34D399; }\n          100% { background-color: #ffffff; }\n        }\n\n        /* Scrollbar customization */\n        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .no-scrollbar {\n          -ms-overflow-style: none;\n          scrollbar-width: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Focus states */\n        input:focus, textarea:focus, select:focus {\n          outline: none;\n          border-color: #FF4D3D !important;\n          box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.1);\n        }\n      `}} />\n\n      {/* 1. MOCK PHONE STATUS BAR */}\n      <div style={{\n        display: \'flex\',\n        justifyContent: \'space-between\',\n        alignItems: \'center\',\n        padding: \'14px 24px 8px 24px\',\n        backgroundColor: \'#F7F7FB\',\n        userSelect: \'none\',\n        zIndex: 10\n      }}>\n        {/* Mock Time */}\n        <span style={{ fontSize: \'14px\', fontWeight: \'700\', color: \'#1F2937\', letterSpacing: \'-0.2px\' }}>\n          {time}\n        </span>\n        \n        {/* Mock Status Icons */}\n        <div style={{ display: \'flex\', alignItems: \'center\', gap: \'6px\' }}>\n          {/* Signal Indicator */}\n          <svg width=\"17\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 17 11\" fill=\"none\">\n            <rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"8\" width=\"2.5\" height=\"3\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"#1F2937\" />\n            <rect x=\"4.5\" y=\"6\" width=\"2.5\" height=\"5\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"#1F2937\" />\n            <rect x=\"8.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"2.5\" height=\"7.5\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"#1F2937\" />\n            <rect x=\"12.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"2.5\" height=\"10.5\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"#1F2937\" />\n          </svg>\n          \n          {/* Wifi Indicator */}\n          <svg width=\"15\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 11\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M7.5 11C8.2 11 8.8 10.4 8.8 9.7C8.8 9 8.2 8.4 7.5 8.4C6.8 8.4 6.2 9 6.2 9.7C6.2 10.4 6.8 11 7.5 11Z\" fill=\"#1F2937\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10.8 6.4C8.9 4.6 6.1 4.6 4.2 6.4C3.8 6.8 3.2 6.8 2.8 6.4C2.4 6 2.4 5.4 2.8 5C5.4 2.4 9.6 2.4 12.2 5C12.6 5.4 12.6 6 12.2 6.4C11.8 6.8 11.2 6.8 10.8 6.4Z\" fill=\"#1F2937\"/>\n            <path d=\"M13.7 3.5C10.3 0.1 4.7 0.1 1.3 3.5C0.9 3.9 0.3 3.9 -0.1 3.5C-0.5 3.1 -0.5 2.5 -0.1 2.1C4.1 -2.1 10.9 -2.1 15.1 2.1C15.5 2.5 15.5 3.1 15.1 3.5C14.7 3.9 14.1 3.9 13.7 3.5Z\" fill=\"#1F2937\"/>\n          </svg>\n\n          {/* Battery Indicator */}\n          <div style={{\n            width: \'22px\',\n            height: \'11px\',\n            border: \'1px solid #1F2937\',\n            borderRadius: \'3px\',\n            padding: \'1px\',\n            display: \'flex\',\n            alignItems: \'center\',\n            position: \'relative\'\n          }}>\n            <div style={{ height: \'100%\', width: \'70%\', backgroundColor: \'#1F2937\', borderRadius: \'1.5px\' }} />\n            <div style={{\n              width: \'1.5px\',\n              height: \'4px\',\n              backgroundColor: \'#1F2937\',\n              borderRadius: \'0 1px 1px 0\',\n              position: \'absolute\',\n              right: \'-2.5px\',\n              top: \'2.5px\'\n            }} />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 2. STICKY HEADER & SECTIONS */}\n      <div style={{\n        backgroundColor: \'#F7F7FB\',\n        borderBottom: \'1px solid #EEEDF2\',\n        zIndex: 5,\n        display: \'flex\',\n        flexDirection: \'column\',\n        gap: \'12px\',\n        padding: \'8px 16px 14px 16px\'\n      }}>\n        {/* Brand Header */}\n        <div style={{ display: \'flex\', justifyContent: \'space-between\', alignItems: \'center\' }}>\n          <h1 style={{\n            fontSize: \'24px\',\n            fontWeight: \'800\',\n            color: \'#1F2937\',\n            margin: 0,\n            fontFamily: \'Nunito, sans-serif\'\n          }}>\n            Quick<span style={{ color: \'#FF4D3D\' }}>Reply</span>\n          </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Modern Search Input Container */}\n        <div style={{ position: \'relative\' }}>\n          <span style={{\n            position: \'absolute\',\n            left: \'14px\',\n            top: \'50%\',\n            transform: \'translateY(-50%)\',\n            display: \'flex\',\n            alignItems: \'center\',\n            color: \'#9CA3AF\'\n          }}>\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n              <circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle>\n              <line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"></line>\n            </svg>\n          </span>\n          <input\n            type=\"text\"\n            placeholder=\"Search responses...\"\n            value={searchQuery}\n            onChange={(e) => setSearchQuery(e.target.value)}\n            style={{\n              width: \'100%\',\n              padding: \'11px 16px 11px 42px\',\n              borderRadius: \'12px\',\n              border: \'1px solid #E5E7EB\',\n              backgroundColor: \'#FFFFFF\',\n              fontSize: \'15px\',\n              fontFamily: \'inherit\',\n              color: \'#1F2937\',\n              boxSizing: \'border-box\',\n              transition: \'border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s\'\n            }}\n          />\n          {searchQuery && (\n            <button\n              onClick={() => setSearchQuery(\'\')}\n              style={{\n                position: \'absolute\',\n                right: \'12px\',\n                top: \'50%\',\n                transform: \'translateY(-50%)\',\n                background: \'none\',\n                border: \'none\',\n                cursor: \'pointer\',\n                color: \'#9CA3AF\',\n                padding: \'4px\'\n              }}\n            >\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n                <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n          )}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Scrollable Categories Row */}\n        <div \n          className=\"no-scrollbar\"\n          style={{\n            display: \'flex\',\n            gap: \'8px\',\n            overflowX: \'auto\',\n            padding: \'2px 0px\',\n            margin: \'0 -16px\',\n            paddingLeft: \'16px\',\n            paddingRight: \'16px\',\n          }}\n        >\n          {CATEGORIES.map((category) => {\n            const isActive = selectedCategory === category;\n            return (\n              <button\n                key={category}\n                onClick={() => setSelectedCategory(category)}\n                style={{\n                  display: \'flex\',\n                  alignItems: \'center\',\n                  gap: \'6px\',\n                  whiteSpace: \'nowrap\',\n                  padding: \'8px 14px\',\n                  borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                  border: \'none\',\n                  backgroundColor: isActive ? \'#FF4D3D\' : \'#FFFFFF\',\n                  color: isActive ? \'#FFFFFF\' : \'#4B5563\',\n                  fontWeight: \'700\',\n                  fontSize: \'14px\',\n                  cursor: \'pointer\',\n                  transition: \'background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s\',\n                  boxShadow: \'0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02)\',\n                  flexShrink: 0\n                }}\n              >\n                {category}\n                <span style={{\n                  fontSize: \'11px\',\n                  padding: \'2px 6px\',\n                  borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                  backgroundColor: isActive ? \'rgba(255,255,255,0.25)\' : \'#F3F4F6\',\n                  color: isActive ? \'#FFFFFF\' : \'#6B7280\',\n                  fontWeight: \'700\',\n                  minWidth: \'14px\',\n                  textAlign: \'center\'\n                }}>\n                  {categoryCounts[category] || 0}\n                </span>\n              </button>\n            );\n          })}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 3. SCROLLABLE SNIPPETS LIST */}\n      <div \n        className=\"no-scrollbar\"\n        style={{\n          flex: 1,\n          overflowY: \'auto\',\n          padding: \'16px\',\n          display: \'flex\',\n          flexDirection: \'column\',\n          gap: \'12px\',\n          paddingBottom: \'90px\' // spacing to make sure FAB doesn\'t overlay essential action item buttons\n        }}\n      >\n        {filteredSnippets.length > 0 ? (\n          filteredSnippets.map((snippet, index) => {\n            const isExpanded = expandedCards.has(snippet.id);\n            const isCopied = copiedSnippetId === snippet.id;\n            \n            return (\n              <div\n                key={snippet.id}\n                onClick={() => toggleCardExpansion(snippet.id)}\n                style={{\n                  backgroundColor: \'#FFFFFF\',\n                  borderRadius: \'16px\',\n                  border: \'1.5px solid #F1F1F5\',\n                  padding: \'16px\',\n                  boxShadow: \'0 4px 12px rgba(117, 127, 233, 0.03)\',\n                  cursor: \'pointer\',\n                  animation: \'slideUpIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards\',\n                  animationDelay: `${index * 0.06}s`,\n                  opacity: 0, // setup for staggered load animation\n                  animationFillMode: \'forwards\',\n                  transition: \'border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s\',\n                  userSelect: \'none\',\n                  ...(isCopied && {\n                    animation: \'pulseSuccess 1.4s ease-out forwards\',\n                  })\n                }}\n              >\n                {/* Header Row */}\n                <div style={{ display: \'flex\', justifyContent: \'space-between\', alignItems: \'center\', marginBottom: \'8px\' }}>\n                  <div style={{ display: \'flex\', alignItems: \'center\', gap: \'8px\' }}>\n                    <span style={{ fontSize: \'18px\' }}>\n                      {getCategoryEmoji(snippet.category)}\n                    </span>\n                    <h3 style={{\n                      fontSize: \'16px\',\n                      fontWeight: \'700\',\n                      color: \'#1F2937\',\n                      margin: 0,\n                      lineHeight: \'1.2\'\n                    }}>\n                      {snippet.title}\n                    </h3>\n                  </div>\n                  <span style={{\n                    fontSize: \'11px\',\n                    fontWeight: \'700\',\n                    backgroundColor: \'rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.08)\',\n                    color: \'#FF4D3D\',\n                    padding: \'4px 8px\',\n                    borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                    letterSpacing: \'0.3px\',\n                    textTransform: \'uppercase\'\n                  }}>\n                    {snippet.category}\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Content body with Expand Trigger */}\n                <div style={{ marginBottom: \'14px\', position: \'relative\' }}>\n                  <p style={{\n                    fontSize: \'14px\',\n                    lineHeight: \'1.5\',\n                    color: \'#4B5563\',\n                    margin: 0,\n                    wordBreak: \'break-word\',\n                    fontFamily: \'\"Nunito Sans\", sans-serif\'\n                  }}>\n                    {isExpanded \n                      ? snippet.body \n                      : (snippet.body.length > 72 \n                          ? `${snippet.body.slice(0, 72)}...` \n                          : snippet.body)\n                    }\n                  </p>\n                  {snippet.body.length > 72 && !isExpanded && (\n                    <span style={{\n                      display: \'inline-block\',\n                      color: \'#9CA3AF\',\n                      fontSize: \'12px\',\n                      fontWeight: \'600\',\n                      marginTop: \'4px\'\n                    }}>\n                      Tap to expand\n                    </span>\n                  )}\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Card Action Buttons Row */}\n                <div style={{\n                  display: \'flex\',\n                  justifyContent: \'space-between\',\n                  alignItems: \'center\',\n                  borderTop: \'1px solid #F3F4F6\',\n                  paddingTop: \'12px\'\n                }}>\n                  <div style={{ display: \'flex\', gap: \'4px\' }}>\n                    {/* Edit button */}\n                    <button\n                      onClick={(e) => handleOpenEdit(e, snippet)}\n                      style={{\n                        padding: \'6px 12px\',\n                        backgroundColor: \'transparent\',\n                        border: \'none\',\n                        color: \'#4B5563\',\n                        fontSize: \'13px\',\n                        fontWeight: \'700\',\n                        borderRadius: \'8px\',\n                        cursor: \'pointer\',\n                        display: \'flex\',\n                        alignItems: \'center\',\n                        gap: \'4px\'\n                      }}\n                    >\n                      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 20h9\"></path>\n                        <path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z\"></path>\n                      </svg>\n                      Edit\n                    </button>\n\n                    {/* Delete button */}\n                    <button\n                      onClick={(e) => handleDelete(e, snippet.id)}\n                      style={{\n                        padding: \'6px 12px\',\n                        backgroundColor: \'transparent\',\n                        border: \'none\',\n                        color: \'#FF4D3D\',\n                        fontSize: \'13px\',\n                        fontWeight: \'700\',\n                        borderRadius: \'8px\',\n                        cursor: \'pointer\',\n                        display: \'flex\',\n                        alignItems: \'center\',\n                        gap: \'4px\'\n                      }}\n                    >\n                      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                        <polyline points=\"3 6 5 6 21 6\"></polyline>\n                        <path d=\"M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6m3 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path>\n                      </svg>\n                      Delete\n                    </button>\n                  </div>\n\n                  {/* Copy Button */}\n                  <button\n                    onClick={(e) => handleCopyText(e, snippet.id, snippet.body)}\n                    style={{\n                      padding: \'7px 14px\',\n                      backgroundColor: isCopied ? \'#10B981\' : \'#FF4D3D\',\n                      border: \'none\',\n                      color: \'#FFFFFF\',\n                      fontSize: \'13px\',\n                      fontWeight: \'700\',\n                      borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                      cursor: \'pointer\',\n                      display: \'flex\',\n                      alignItems: \'center\',\n                      gap: \'4px\',\n                      boxShadow: isCopied \n                        ? \'0 4px 10px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2)\' \n                        : \'0 4px 10px rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.2)\',\n                      transition: \'background-color 0.25s, transform 0.1s active\'\n                    }}\n                  >\n                    {isCopied ? (\n                      <>\n                        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"3\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                          <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline>\n                        </svg>\n                        Copied\n                      </>\n                    ) : (\n                      <>\n                        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                          <rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect>\n                          <path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path>\n                        </svg>\n                        Copy\n                      </>\n                    )}\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            );\n          })\n        ) : (\n          <div style={{\n            display: \'flex\',\n            flexDirection: \'column\',\n            alignItems: \'center\',\n            justifyContent: \'center\',\n            height: \'220px\',\n            color: \'#6B7280\',\n            gap: \'8px\'\n          }}>\n            <span style={{ fontSize: \'32px\' }}>\360\237\224\215</span>\n            <p style={{ margin: 0, fontWeight: \'700\', fontSize: \'15px\' }}>No matches found</p>\n            <p style={{ margin: 0, fontSize: \'13px\', color: \'#9CA3AF\' }}>Try adjusting your search criteria</p>\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 4. TOAST NOTIFICATION (Positional anchor right above FAB) */}\n      <div style={{\n        position: \'absolute\',\n        bottom: \'96px\',\n        left: \'16px\',\n        right: \'16px\',\n        backgroundColor: \'#1F2937\',\n        color: \'#FFFFFF\',\n        borderRadius: \'12px\',\n        padding: \'12px 16px\',\n        boxShadow: \'0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)\',\n        display: \'flex\',\n        alignItems: \'center\',\n        gap: \'10px\',\n        zIndex: 40,\n        pointerEvents: \'none\',\n        transform: toast.visible ? \'translateY(0)\' : \'translateY(40px)\',\n        opacity: toast.visible ? 1 : 0,\n        transition: \'transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), opacity 0.3s ease\'\n      }}>\n        <div style={{\n          width: \'6px\',\n          height: \'6px\',\n          borderRadius: \'50%\',\n          backgroundColor: \'#FF4D3D\'\n        }} />\n        <span style={{ fontSize: \'13px\', fontWeight: \'700\' }}>\n          {toast.message}\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 5. FLOATING ACTION BUTTON (FAB) */}\n      <button\n        onClick={handleOpenAdd}\n        style={{\n          position: \'absolute\',\n          bottom: \'24px\',\n          right: \'24px\',\n          width: \'56px\',\n          height: \'56px\',\n          borderRadius: \'50%\',\n          backgroundColor: \'#FF4D3D\',\n          border: \'none\',\n          color: \'#FFFFFF\',\n          display: \'flex\',\n          alignItems: \'center\',\n          justifyContent: \'center\',\n          boxShadow: \'0 8px 18px rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.35)\',\n          cursor: \'pointer\',\n          zIndex: 30,\n          transition: \'transform 0.15s ease\'\n        }}\n        onMouseDown={(e) => e.currentTarget.style.transform = \'scale(0.92)\'}\n        onMouseUp={(e) => e.currentTarget.style.transform = \'scale(1)\'}\n        onTouchStart={(e) => e.currentTarget.style.transform = \'scale(0.92)\'}\n        onTouchEnd={(e) => e.currentTarget.style.transform = \'scale(1)\'}\n      >\n        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"3\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"></line>\n          <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line>\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n\n      {/* 6. BOTTOM SHEET BACKDROP & OVERLAY */}\n      <div \n        onClick={() => setIsBottomSheetOpen(false)}\n        style={{\n          position: \'absolute\',\n          top: 0,\n          left: 0,\n          right: 0,\n          bottom: 0,\n          backgroundColor: \'rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45)\',\n          backdropFilter: \'blur(3px)\',\n          zIndex: 50,\n          pointerEvents: isBottomSheetOpen ? \'auto\' : \'none\',\n          opacity: isBottomSheetOpen ? 1 : 0,\n          transition: \'opacity 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)\'\n        }}\n      />\n\n      {/* 7. BOTTOM SHEET ELEMENT */}\n      <div style={{\n        position: \'absolute\',\n        bottom: 0,\n        left: 0,\n        right: 0,\n        backgroundColor: \'#FFFFFF\',\n        borderTopLeftRadius: \'24px\',\n        borderTopRightRadius: \'24px\',\n        padding: \'8px 20px 24px 20px\',\n        zIndex: 60,\n        boxShadow: \'0 -10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)\',\n        transform: isBottomSheetOpen ? \'translateY(0)\' : \'translateY(100%)\',\n        transition: \'transform 0.32s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)\',\n        display: \'flex\',\n        flexDirection: \'column\'\n      }}>\n        {/* Top Drag Handle Bar */}\n        <div style={{\n          width: \'36px\',\n          height: \'5px\',\n          backgroundColor: \'#E5E7EB\',\n          borderRadius: \'100px\',\n          margin: \'0 auto 16px auto\',\n          cursor: \'pointer\'\n        }} onClick={() => setIsBottomSheetOpen(false)} />\n\n        <div style={{ display: \'flex\', justifyContent: \'space-between\', alignItems: \'center\', marginBottom: \'18px\' }}>\n          <h2 style={{\n            fontSize: \'18px\',\n            fontWeight: \'800\',\n            color: \'#1F2937\',\n            margin: 0\n          }}>\n            {editingSnippet ? \'Edit Snippet\' : \'New Snippet\'}\n          </h2>\n          <button\n            onClick={() => setIsBottomSheetOpen(false)}\n            style={{\n              background: \'#F3F4F6\',\n              border: \'none\',\n              borderRadius: \'50%\',\n              width: \'28px\',\n              height: \'28px\',\n              display: \'flex\',\n              alignItems: \'center\',\n              justifyContent: \'center\',\n              cursor: \'pointer\',\n              color: \'#4B5563\'\n            }}\n          >\n            <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"3\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n              <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n              <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <form onSubmit={handleSave} style={{ display: \'flex\', flexDirection: \'column\', gap: \'14px\' }}>\n          {/* Title Input */}\n          <div style={{ display: \'flex\', flexDirection: \'column\', gap: \'6px\' }}>\n            <label style={{ fontSize: \'13px\', fontWeight: \'700\', color: \'#4B5563\' }}>Snippet Title</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"text\"\n              required\n              placeholder=\"e.g. Return Policy Overview\"\n              value={formTitle}\n              onChange={(e) => setFormTitle(e.target.value)}\n              style={{\n                padding: \'12px\',\n                borderRadius: \'12px\',\n                border: \'1.5px solid #E5E7EB\',\n                fontSize: \'15px\',\n                fontFamily: \'inherit\',\n                color: \'#1F2937\',\n                width: \'100%\',\n                boxSizing: \'border-box\'\n              }}\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Category Selector Pills inside form */}\n          <div style={{ display: \'flex\', flexDirection: \'column\', gap: \'8px\' }}>\n            <label style={{ fontSize: \'13px\', fontWeight: \'700\', color: \'#4B5563\' }}>Category</label>\n            <div style={{ display: \'flex\', gap: \'8px\', flexWrap: \'wrap\' }}>\n              {CATEGORIES.slice(1).map((category) => {\n                const isSelected = formCategory === category;\n                return (\n                  <button\n                    key={category}\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    onClick={() => setFormCategory(category)}\n                    style={{\n                      padding: \'8px 14px\',\n                      borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                      border: \'1.5px solid\',\n                      borderColor: isSelected ? \'#FF4D3D\' : \'#E5E7EB\',\n                      backgroundColor: isSelected ? \'#FF4D3D\' : \'transparent\',\n                      color: isSelected ? \'#FFFFFF\' : \'#4B5563\',\n                      fontWeight: \'700\',\n                      fontSize: \'13px\',\n                      cursor: \'pointer\',\n                      transition: \'all 0.15s ease\'\n                    }}\n                  >\n                    {getCategoryEmoji(category)} {category}\n                  </button>\n                );\n              })}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Body Textarea */}\n          <div style={{ display: \'flex\', flexDirection: \'column\', gap: \'6px\' }}>\n            <label style={{ fontSize: \'13px\', fontWeight: \'700\', color: \'#4B5563\' }}>Message Text</label>\n            <textarea\n              required\n              rows={4}\n              placeholder=\"Paste or write the response sent to customers...\"\n              value={formBody}\n              onChange={(e) => setFormBody(e.target.value)}\n              style={{\n                padding: \'12px\',\n                borderRadius: \'12px\',\n                border: \'1.5px solid #E5E7EB\',\n                fontSize: \'15px\',\n                fontFamily: \'inherit\',\n                color: \'#1F2937\',\n                width: \'100%\',\n                boxSizing: \'border-box\',\n                resize: \'none\',\n                lineHeight: \'1.4\'\n              }}\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Save Action Button */}\n          <button\n            type=\"submit\"\n            disabled={!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()}\n            style={{\n              marginTop: \'8px\',\n              padding: \'14px\',\n              borderRadius: \'14px\',\n              border: \'none\',\n              backgroundColor: (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) ? \'#F3F4F6\' : \'#FF4D3D\',\n              color: (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) ? \'#9CA3AF\' : \'#FFFFFF\',\n              fontWeight: \'800\',\n              fontSize: \'15px\',\n              cursor: (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) ? \'not-allowed\' : \'pointer\',\n              display: \'flex\',\n              alignItems: \'center\',\n              justifyContent: \'center\',\n              gap: \'6px\',\n              boxShadow: (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) ? \'none\' : \'0 6px 16px rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.25)\',\n              transition: \'background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s\'\n            }}\n          >\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"3\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n              <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline>\n            </svg>\n            Save Snippet\n          </button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Key Technical Aspects Included:\n*   **iOS Native Feel:** Integrates styled battery, signals, wifi, and clock displays inside a mocked native-sized layout [1].\n*   **Interactive Search & Filter:** Dynamically updates category tag count badges inline based on total occurrences [1].\n*   **Micro-Animations:** Pure JSX-friendly custom CSS is injected to support staggered load slide-ins, backdrop overlays, slide-up panels, and card background flashes on copy actions [1].\n*   **SSR Compatibility:** The simulated system clock is mounted via Client Component standard cycles to avoid Next.js hydration anomalies [1]."
    items {
      text: "User: do this in next js\nmobile first \n\n> Build a mobile-first React web app called **QuickReply** \342\200\224 a snippet manager for solopreneurs and online sellers who answer repetitive DMs on WhatsApp, Instagram, and email.\n>\n> **Design language:** Coral red (`#FF4D3D`) as the primary accent. White cards on a light gray background (`#F7F7FB`). Rounded corners everywhere (12\342\200\22316px). Nunito + Nunito Sans from Google Fonts. Feels like a native iOS app. Max width 430px centered.\n>\n> **Layout structure:**\n> - Sticky header with app name \"QuickReply\" (coral accent on \"Reply\"), a search input, and horizontal scrollable pill tabs for category filtering: All, Shipping, Returns, Pricing, General \342\200\224 each showing a count badge\n> - Scrollable snippet card list below\n> - Floating coral FAB button (56px circle, bottom right) to add new snippets\n>\n> **Snippet cards:**\n> - White card with 16px border radius, subtle shadow\n> - Top row: emoji icon + bold title + coral category pill badge\n> - Body text collapsed to ~72 chars by default; tap card to expand full text\n> - Bottom row: Edit button, Delete button (coral), and a coral Copy button (pill shape)\n> - Copy button animates to green with a checkmark on success; card flashes green briefly\n> - Cards animate in with a staggered slideUp on first render\n>\n> **Add/Edit flow:**\n> - Tapping FAB or Edit opens a bottom sheet that slides up from the bottom (not a modal popup)\n> - Bottom sheet has: drag handle, title input, category selector (pill buttons, coral when active), textarea for message body, and a Save button (coral, disabled-styled when fields are empty)\n> - Tapping the backdrop closes the sheet with a slide-down animation\n>\n> **Data:**\n> - Store snippets in React state (no backend needed)\n> - Preload 8 sample snippets across the 4 categories\n> - Each snippet: `{ id, category, title, body }`\n>\n> **Feedback:**\n> - Dark toast notification slides up from above the FAB when copying, saving, or deleting\n>\n> **Tech:** Single `.jsx` file. React with hooks only. No external UI libraries. Inline styles throughout. Google Fonts via a `<link>` tag injected in a `useEffect`..\nModel: **Defining the Objective**\n\nI\'m solidifying the core objective: a mobile-first React web app, dubbed QuickReply, built with Next.js. My immediate focus is on a single-file solution, considering either the Page router or App router. I\'m leaning toward a page component that can be easily integrated into a Next.js route.\n\n\n**Refining the Approach**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a single, clean `.jsx` page component that I can directly integrate into Next.js. The emphasis is on highly refined styling using inline styles exclusively, avoiding external CSS files or Tailwind for self-containment. Though media queries are tricky, I plan to leverage helper style objects and CSS variables. I\'m exploring adding a small `<style>` tag, if needed, for more complex animations or hover states, though I expect inline styling to cover most of it.\n\n\n**Implementing the Styles**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the styling details. My current focus is implementing keyframe animations, scrollbar hiding, and incorporating system-level styles, all through inline style objects. The mobile-first design will feature a max width of 430px centered, with a mock iOS status bar. The core design language includes coral red accents and white cards on a light gray background, rounded corners, and Nunito fonts. I\'ll inject the fonts using a `<link>` tag within a `useEffect`. The layout starts with the status bar, a sticky header with the app name, search input, and horizontal scrollable pill tabs.\n\n\n**Detailing the UI Components**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the UI components for QuickReply. I\'ve broken down each element: scrollable list of snippet cards, the FAB (floating action button), and the add/edit flow via a bottom sheet that slides up. Each snippet card will display an emoji, a bold title, and a coral-colored category pill. The body collapses, expanding on tap. Editing is done through a bottom sheet with inputs and a save button. I will start with React state, preloaded with 8 sample snippets.\n\n\n**Adding Notifications**\n\nI\'m now integrating dark toast notifications that slide up from above the FAB to provide feedback on actions like copying, saving, and deleting snippets. I\'m focusing on the visual and UX aspects. My next step will be to think about the component structure using the Next.js App Router, using a client component for direct manipulation. I am planning on mock-up of the phone-framed structure, for the status bar, and other design elements.\n\n\n**Expanding the Snippets**\n\nI am now expanding the initial set of predefined snippet cards to include a wider range of customer service inquiries. I have incorporated responses for order tracking, international shipping, return policies, damaged items, discount codes, wholesale rates, and general business hours, adding more versatility. Each snippet card is being crafted with an emoji, clear title, and relevant category to help quickly locate the needed response.\n\n\n**Adding the Sample Snippets**\n\nI\'m now populating the application with some sample responses, and including additional \"thank you\" greetings. I am expanding and organizing the responses with a bit more clarity and detail. I am working towards a more complete set of sample replies to customer service queries.\n\n\n\n**Refining the Styles**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the base styles and animations within the application. I have incorporated several keyframe animations for toast notifications and other UI elements. I have also added rules to hide scrollbars for a cleaner look and feel, and am now integrating general system styles and initial values for common UI components. I\'ve also added pulse animation for green elements.\n\n\n**Designing the Status Bar**\n\nI\'m now crafting the mock iOS status bar component, aiming for authenticity. I\'m focusing on dynamic time display using a `useState` hook and `useEffect` for real-time updates. The component will render a compact status bar, mirroring system details, for a native feel.\n\n**State Management Considerations**\n\nI\'ve outlined my state management strategy: `snippets` will hold the preloaded array, `searchQuery` is a string for filtering, `selectedCategory` will track the currently active category, and `editingSnippet` will hold the object being modified. This gives me a clear direction for data handling.\n\n\n**Defining Component State**\n\nI\'m now defining the component state, including `isBottomSheetOpen`, the `toast` object, and `copiedSnippetId`. I\'m also planning the filter system, including category and search query matching. For the slide-up animation I will use staggered delays. The bottom sheet will be a container with position fixed or absolute, contained perfectly within the phone mockup.\n\n\n**Implementing the Sheet**\n\nI\'m now fully focused on the bottom sheet implementation, and after experimenting, I\'ve found that absolute positioning within the 430px container is the best approach. It will provide perfect integration with the phone mockup, and give me more control. I need to define state variables for form data: title, category, and body, and initialize with default values. The \"Save\" button is disabled until both title and body are populated. I also have the notification toast just above the FAB.\n\n\n**Adding Copy Functionality**\n\nI\'m now implementing the copy logic. I\'m focusing on `navigator.clipboard.writeText(body)` functionality, tracking `copiedSnippetId`, and displaying success toasts. The success toast will be set with a \"Snippet copied to clipboard!\" message, which will clear after 2 seconds. I\'m also planning to incorporate a visual flash animation on the snippet card upon successful copy. I\'m using an array, or set, for expanded snippet IDs.\n\n\n**Defining Card Expansion**\n\nI\'m now refining the snippet card expansion logic. I\'ve switched from a single active index to a toggle set, `expandedCardIds`, for expanded cards. Tapping toggles expansion, and if the card ID is in `expandedCardIds`, it shows the full body; otherwise, it displays a truncated version. I\'ll add visual cues for collapsed state, and incorporate the appropriate colors.\n\nI\'m also setting colors and fonts. I\'m using Nunito and Nunito Sans, with primary color `#FF4D3D`, and various gray shades for the background, text, and borders, for a refined aesthetic.\n\n\n**Crafting the FAB**\n\nI\'m now laser-focused on implementing the FAB and designing the status bar icons. I\'m building simple SVG icons for battery, signal, and Wi-Fi to create a high-fidelity look. The FAB will be fixed within the mockup, using absolute positioning and a circular shape with a shadow for depth, and active scaling upon touch. I\'m committed to clear structure and semantic HTML for React code.\n\n\n**Adding Category Filtering**\n\nI\'m now integrating the category filter system with a horizontal row of buttons, including accurate count badges for each category: \"All,\" \"Shipping,\" \"Returns,\" \"Pricing,\" and \"General.\" I\'m ensuring exact category matching with a dedicated array. I\'ll need to use state for the sheet open, transitioning styling using inline transitions and a semi-transparent backdrop. I plan to use transitions for the backdrop.\n\n\n**Refining the Transitions**\n\nI\'m now refining the transitions, focusing on smooth and instant enter/exit animations for both the bottom sheet and toast notifications, based on their respective state variables. The bottom sheet utilizes `translateY` and `opacity` to slide in and out seamlessly, while the toast employs a similar strategy with `bottom` and `opacity`. The key to elegant transitions is their instant responsiveness and handling both enter/exit states. I will use a helper function to trigger the toast.\n\n\n**Enhancing Icon Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating optimized SVG icons directly into the UI for all essential buttons, including Edit, Delete, Plus, and Search, to improve performance. I am also working on the category selector using horizontal pills, and verifying that the key layout elements align perfectly.\n\n\n**Finalizing the Snippet Content**\n\nI\'m finalizing the snippet content and ensuring each card starts with a fitting emoji representing the category. I am now hardcoding those emojis in a helper, keeping them in the object, and creating some more professional templates. Each snippet reflects realistic solopreneur needs.\n\n\n**Calculating the Counts**\n\nI\'m now calculating the category count badges dynamically. I\'ve implemented logic to show accurate counts for \"All,\" \"Shipping,\" \"Returns,\" \"Pricing,\" and \"General\" based on filtered snippets, ensuring a data-driven approach to the UI.\n\n\n\n**Defining the Viewport**\n\nI\'m now implementing viewport height and centering with a `.device-container` class. For mobile, it\'s 100vh or 100dvh, with no shadow, and on desktop, it\'s capped at 430px with a shadow, for a clean app-like preview. The styling is now mobile first.\n\n\n**Optimizing Component Code**\n\nI\'m now focusing on ensuring clean, well-commented code. I\'m writing error-handling for `navigator.clipboard`, with fallback, and refining animations for copy feedback and save button states. I\'m building a \'use client\' component to work with a Next.js Page.\n\n\n\nModel: Here is a self-contained, mobile-first Next.js Page component (`page.jsx` or `index.jsx`) for **QuickReply** [1]. It is designed with standard React hooks, elegant SVG icons, micro-animations, and responsive shell optimization. \n\nTo prevent hydration mismatch issues common in Next.js SSR, a mounted state check is included for client-side calculations (such as the simulated status bar clock) [1].\n\n### Implementation\n\n```jsx\n\'use client\';\n\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useRef, useMemo } from \'react\';\n\n// Preloaded sample snippets data\nconst INITIAL_SNIPPETS = [\n  {\n    id: 1,\n    category: \'Shipping\',\n    title: \'Order Tracking Link\',\n    body: \'Hey there! \360\237\223\246 Your order is on its way. You can track its progress here: https://track.quickreply.io/order-status\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 2,\n    category: \'Shipping\',\n    title: \'International Shipping Policy\',\n    body: \'Yes, we ship globally! \360\237\214\215 International delivery usually takes between 7 to 14 business days depending on customs.\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 3,\n    category: \'Returns\',\n    title: \'30-Day Policy Details\',\n    body: \'We offer a 30-day return policy! \360\237\224\204 Items must be in their original packaging. Start your return at returns.quickreply.io\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 4,\n    category: \'Returns\',\n    title: \'Damaged Items Procedure\',\n    body: \'I am so sorry to hear that! \360\237\245\272 Please share your order number along with a photo of the damaged item so we can ship a replacement.\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 5,\n    category: \'Pricing\',\n    title: \'First Order Discount\',\n    body: \'Welcome aboard! \360\237\216\211 You can use the promo code \"WELCOME10\" at checkout to get an extra 10% discount on your first purchase.\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 6,\n    category: \'Pricing\',\n    title: \'Bulk Pricing Inquiry\',\n    body: \'Thanks for reaching out! \360\237\222\274 We offer discounts for wholesale orders of 50 units or more. Please email wholesale@quickreply.io\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 7,\n    category: \'General\',\n    title: \'Standard Business Hours\',\n    body: \'Our support hours are Mon-Fri, 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM EST. \360\237\225\222 We will do our absolute best to get back to you within 2 hours.\'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 8,\n    category: \'General\',\n    title: \'Closing Appreciation\',\n    body: \'Thank you for choosing us today! \360\237\231\214 Let me know if you need help with anything else. Have a fantastic rest of your day!\'\n  }\n];\n\nconst CATEGORIES = [\'All\', \'Shipping\', \'Returns\', \'Pricing\', \'General\'];\n\nexport default function QuickReply() {\n  const [snippets, setSnippets] = useState(INITIAL_SNIPPETS);\n  const [selectedCategory, setSelectedCategory] = useState(\'All\');\n  const [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState(\'\');\n  \n  // UI states\n  const [mounted, setMounted] = useState(false);\n  const [time, setTime] = useState(\'09:41\');\n  const [expandedCards, setExpandedCards] = useState(new Set());\n  const [copiedSnippetId, setCopiedSnippetId] = useState(null);\n  \n  // Bottom Sheet States\n  const [isBottomSheetOpen, setIsBottomSheetOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [editingSnippet, setEditingSnippet] = useState(null);\n  const [formTitle, setFormTitle] = useState(\'\');\n  const [formCategory, setFormCategory] = useState(\'General\');\n  const [formBody, setFormBody] = useState(\'\');\n  \n  // Toast Notification State\n  const [toast, setToast] = useState({ visible: false, message: \'\' });\n  const toastTimeoutRef = useRef(null);\n\n  // Injects Google Fonts via link tag and updates simulated device clock\n  useEffect(() => {\n    setMounted(true);\n    \n    // Inject Fonts\n    const link = document.createElement(\'link\');\n    link.rel = \'stylesheet\';\n    link.href = \'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Nunito+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap\';\n    document.head.appendChild(link);\n\n    // Update Simulated clock\n    const updateTime = () => {\n      const now = new Date();\n      const hours = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, \'0\');\n      const minutes = String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, \'0\');\n      setTime(`${hours}:${minutes}`);\n    };\n    updateTime();\n    const clockInterval = setInterval(updateTime, 60000);\n\n    return () => {\n      document.head.removeChild(link);\n      clearInterval(clockInterval);\n      if (toastTimeoutRef.current) clearTimeout(toastTimeoutRef.current);\n    };\n  }, []);\n\n  // Filter snippets based on Category + Search Term\n  const filteredSnippets = useMemo(() => {\n    return snippets.filter((snippet) => {\n      const matchesCategory = selectedCategory === \'All\' || snippet.category === selectedCategory;\n      const matchesSearch = \n        snippet.title.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery.toLowerCase()) ||\n        snippet.body.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery.toLowerCase());\n      return matchesCategory && matchesSearch;\n    });\n  }, [snippets, selectedCategory, searchQuery]);\n\n  // Compute item counts for the category tabs\n  const categoryCounts = useMemo(() => {\n    const counts = { All: snippets.length };\n    CATEGORIES.slice(1).forEach(cat => {\n      counts[cat] = snippets.filter(s => s.category === cat).length;\n    });\n    return counts;\n  }, [snippets]);\n\n  // Trigger Toast feedback\n  const triggerToast = (message) => {\n    if (toastTimeoutRef.current) clearTimeout(toastTimeoutRef.current);\n    setToast({ visible: true, message });\n    toastTimeoutRef.current = setTimeout(() => {\n      setToast({ visible: false, message: \'\' });\n    }, 2500);\n  };\n\n  // Expand or collapse card text body\n  const toggleCardExpansion = (id) => {\n    const next = new Set(expandedCards);\n    if (next.has(id)) {\n      next.delete(id);\n    } else {\n      next.add(id);\n    }\n    setExpandedCards(next);\n  };\n\n  // Copy to clipboard with success state\n  const handleCopyText = async (e, id, text) => {\n    e.stopPropagation(); // Avoid expanding/collapsing on copy button tap\n    try {\n      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);\n      setCopiedSnippetId(id);\n      triggerToast(\'Copied to clipboard!\');\n      \n      // Reset card visual state\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        setCopiedSnippetId(null);\n      }, 1500);\n    } catch (err) {\n      triggerToast(\'Failed to copy text.\');\n    }\n  };\n\n  // Open bottom sheet for fresh layout\n  const handleOpenAdd = () => {\n    setEditingSnippet(null);\n    setFormTitle(\'\');\n    setFormCategory(\'General\');\n    setFormBody(\'\');\n    setIsBottomSheetOpen(true);\n  };\n\n  // Open bottom sheet populated with existing details\n  const handleOpenEdit = (e, snippet) => {\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    setEditingSnippet(snippet);\n    setFormTitle(snippet.title);\n    setFormCategory(snippet.category);\n    setFormBody(snippet.body);\n    setIsBottomSheetOpen(true);\n  };\n\n  // Handle Form Submission\n  const handleSave = (e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) return;\n\n    if (editingSnippet) {\n      // Edit logic\n      setSnippets(prev => prev.map(s => s.id === editingSnippet.id ? {\n        ...s,\n        title: formTitle.trim(),\n        category: formCategory,\n        body: formBody.trim()\n      } : s));\n      triggerToast(\'Snippet updated successfully\');\n    } else {\n      // Add logic\n      const newSnippet = {\n        id: Date.now(),\n        title: formTitle.trim(),\n        category: formCategory,\n        body: formBody.trim()\n      };\n      setSnippets(prev => [newSnippet, ...prev]);\n      triggerToast(\'New snippet saved\');\n    }\n    setIsBottomSheetOpen(false);\n  };\n\n  // Delete Action\n  const handleDelete = (e, id) => {\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    setSnippets(prev => prev.filter(s => s.id !== id));\n    triggerToast(\'Snippet deleted\');\n  };\n\n  const getCategoryEmoji = (category) => {\n    switch (category) {\n      case \'Shipping\': return \'\360\237\223\246\';\n      case \'Returns\': return \'\360\237\224\204\';\n      case \'Pricing\': return \'\360\237\222\260\';\n      case \'General\': return \'\360\237\222\254\';\n      default: return \'\360\237\223\235\';\n    }\n  };\n\n  // Return SSR-friendly initial wrapper\n  if (!mounted) {\n    return (\n      <div style={{ display: \'flex\', justifyContent: \'center\', alignItems: \'center\', minHeight: \'100vh\', background: \'#e1e1e6\' }}>\n        <p style={{ fontFamily: \'sans-serif\', color: \'#6B7280\' }}>Loading QuickReply...</p>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"app-viewport\">\n      <style dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: `\n        body {\n          margin: 0;\n          padding: 0;\n          background-color: #E2E8F0;\n          font-family: \'Nunito\', \'Nunito Sans\', sans-serif;\n          -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n          display: flex;\n          justify-content: center;\n          align-items: center;\n          min-height: 100vh;\n        }\n\n        .app-viewport {\n          width: 100%;\n          max-width: 430px;\n          height: 100vh;\n          max-height: 932px; /* standard iPhone Pro Max aspect height */\n          background-color: #F7F7FB;\n          position: relative;\n          display: flex;\n          flex-direction: column;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 430px) {\n          .app-viewport {\n            max-height: 100vh;\n            border-radius: 0;\n            box-shadow: none;\n          }\n        }\n\n        /* Animations */\n        @keyframes slideUpIn {\n          from {\n            transform: translateY(24px);\n            opacity: 0;\n          }\n          to {\n            transform: translateY(0);\n            opacity: 1;\n          }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulseSuccess {\n          0% { background-color: #ffffff; }\n          30% { background-color: #ECFDF5; border-color: #34D399; }\n          100% { background-color: #ffffff; }\n        }\n\n        /* Scrollbar customization */\n        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .no-scrollbar {\n          -ms-overflow-style: none;\n          scrollbar-width: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Focus states */\n        input:focus, textarea:focus, select:focus {\n          outline: none;\n          border-color: #FF4D3D !important;\n          box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.1);\n        }\n      `}} />\n\n      {/* 1. MOCK PHONE STATUS BAR */}\n      <div style={{\n        display: \'flex\',\n        justifyContent: \'space-between\',\n        alignItems: \'center\',\n        padding: \'14px 24px 8px 24px\',\n        backgroundColor: \'#F7F7FB\',\n        userSelect: \'none\',\n        zIndex: 10\n      }}>\n        {/* Mock Time */}\n        <span style={{ fontSize: \'14px\', fontWeight: \'700\', color: \'#1F2937\', letterSpacing: \'-0.2px\' }}>\n          {time}\n        </span>\n        \n        {/* Mock Status Icons */}\n        <div style={{ display: \'flex\', alignItems: \'center\', gap: \'6px\' }}>\n          {/* Signal Indicator */}\n          <svg width=\"17\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 17 11\" fill=\"none\">\n            <rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"8\" width=\"2.5\" height=\"3\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"#1F2937\" />\n            <rect x=\"4.5\" y=\"6\" width=\"2.5\" height=\"5\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"#1F2937\" />\n            <rect x=\"8.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"2.5\" height=\"7.5\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"#1F2937\" />\n            <rect x=\"12.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"2.5\" height=\"10.5\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"#1F2937\" />\n          </svg>\n          \n          {/* Wifi Indicator */}\n          <svg width=\"15\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 11\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M7.5 11C8.2 11 8.8 10.4 8.8 9.7C8.8 9 8.2 8.4 7.5 8.4C6.8 8.4 6.2 9 6.2 9.7C6.2 10.4 6.8 11 7.5 11Z\" fill=\"#1F2937\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10.8 6.4C8.9 4.6 6.1 4.6 4.2 6.4C3.8 6.8 3.2 6.8 2.8 6.4C2.4 6 2.4 5.4 2.8 5C5.4 2.4 9.6 2.4 12.2 5C12.6 5.4 12.6 6 12.2 6.4C11.8 6.8 11.2 6.8 10.8 6.4Z\" fill=\"#1F2937\"/>\n            <path d=\"M13.7 3.5C10.3 0.1 4.7 0.1 1.3 3.5C0.9 3.9 0.3 3.9 -0.1 3.5C-0.5 3.1 -0.5 2.5 -0.1 2.1C4.1 -2.1 10.9 -2.1 15.1 2.1C15.5 2.5 15.5 3.1 15.1 3.5C14.7 3.9 14.1 3.9 13.7 3.5Z\" fill=\"#1F2937\"/>\n          </svg>\n\n          {/* Battery Indicator */}\n          <div style={{\n            width: \'22px\',\n            height: \'11px\',\n            border: \'1px solid #1F2937\',\n            borderRadius: \'3px\',\n            padding: \'1px\',\n            display: \'flex\',\n            alignItems: \'center\',\n            position: \'relative\'\n          }}>\n            <div style={{ height: \'100%\', width: \'70%\', backgroundColor: \'#1F2937\', borderRadius: \'1.5px\' }} />\n            <div style={{\n              width: \'1.5px\',\n              height: \'4px\',\n              backgroundColor: \'#1F2937\',\n              borderRadius: \'0 1px 1px 0\',\n              position: \'absolute\',\n              right: \'-2.5px\',\n              top: \'2.5px\'\n            }} />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 2. STICKY HEADER & SECTIONS */}\n      <div style={{\n        backgroundColor: \'#F7F7FB\',\n        borderBottom: \'1px solid #EEEDF2\',\n        zIndex: 5,\n        display: \'flex\',\n        flexDirection: \'column\',\n        gap: \'12px\',\n        padding: \'8px 16px 14px 16px\'\n      }}>\n        {/* Brand Header */}\n        <div style={{ display: \'flex\', justifyContent: \'space-between\', alignItems: \'center\' }}>\n          <h1 style={{\n            fontSize: \'24px\',\n            fontWeight: \'800\',\n            color: \'#1F2937\',\n            margin: 0,\n            fontFamily: \'Nunito, sans-serif\'\n          }}>\n            Quick<span style={{ color: \'#FF4D3D\' }}>Reply</span>\n          </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Modern Search Input Container */}\n        <div style={{ position: \'relative\' }}>\n          <span style={{\n            position: \'absolute\',\n            left: \'14px\',\n            top: \'50%\',\n            transform: \'translateY(-50%)\',\n            display: \'flex\',\n            alignItems: \'center\',\n            color: \'#9CA3AF\'\n          }}>\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n              <circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle>\n              <line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"></line>\n            </svg>\n          </span>\n          <input\n            type=\"text\"\n            placeholder=\"Search responses...\"\n            value={searchQuery}\n            onChange={(e) => setSearchQuery(e.target.value)}\n            style={{\n              width: \'100%\',\n              padding: \'11px 16px 11px 42px\',\n              borderRadius: \'12px\',\n              border: \'1px solid #E5E7EB\',\n              backgroundColor: \'#FFFFFF\',\n              fontSize: \'15px\',\n              fontFamily: \'inherit\',\n              color: \'#1F2937\',\n              boxSizing: \'border-box\',\n              transition: \'border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s\'\n            }}\n          />\n          {searchQuery && (\n            <button\n              onClick={() => setSearchQuery(\'\')}\n              style={{\n                position: \'absolute\',\n                right: \'12px\',\n                top: \'50%\',\n                transform: \'translateY(-50%)\',\n                background: \'none\',\n                border: \'none\',\n                cursor: \'pointer\',\n                color: \'#9CA3AF\',\n                padding: \'4px\'\n              }}\n            >\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n                <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n          )}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Scrollable Categories Row */}\n        <div \n          className=\"no-scrollbar\"\n          style={{\n            display: \'flex\',\n            gap: \'8px\',\n            overflowX: \'auto\',\n            padding: \'2px 0px\',\n            margin: \'0 -16px\',\n            paddingLeft: \'16px\',\n            paddingRight: \'16px\',\n          }}\n        >\n          {CATEGORIES.map((category) => {\n            const isActive = selectedCategory === category;\n            return (\n              <button\n                key={category}\n                onClick={() => setSelectedCategory(category)}\n                style={{\n                  display: \'flex\',\n                  alignItems: \'center\',\n                  gap: \'6px\',\n                  whiteSpace: \'nowrap\',\n                  padding: \'8px 14px\',\n                  borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                  border: \'none\',\n                  backgroundColor: isActive ? \'#FF4D3D\' : \'#FFFFFF\',\n                  color: isActive ? \'#FFFFFF\' : \'#4B5563\',\n                  fontWeight: \'700\',\n                  fontSize: \'14px\',\n                  cursor: \'pointer\',\n                  transition: \'background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s\',\n                  boxShadow: \'0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02)\',\n                  flexShrink: 0\n                }}\n              >\n                {category}\n                <span style={{\n                  fontSize: \'11px\',\n                  padding: \'2px 6px\',\n                  borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                  backgroundColor: isActive ? \'rgba(255,255,255,0.25)\' : \'#F3F4F6\',\n                  color: isActive ? \'#FFFFFF\' : \'#6B7280\',\n                  fontWeight: \'700\',\n                  minWidth: \'14px\',\n                  textAlign: \'center\'\n                }}>\n                  {categoryCounts[category] || 0}\n                </span>\n              </button>\n            );\n          })}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 3. SCROLLABLE SNIPPETS LIST */}\n      <div \n        className=\"no-scrollbar\"\n        style={{\n          flex: 1,\n          overflowY: \'auto\',\n          padding: \'16px\',\n          display: \'flex\',\n          flexDirection: \'column\',\n          gap: \'12px\',\n          paddingBottom: \'90px\' // spacing to make sure FAB doesn\'t overlay essential action item buttons\n        }}\n      >\n        {filteredSnippets.length > 0 ? (\n          filteredSnippets.map((snippet, index) => {\n            const isExpanded = expandedCards.has(snippet.id);\n            const isCopied = copiedSnippetId === snippet.id;\n            \n            return (\n              <div\n                key={snippet.id}\n                onClick={() => toggleCardExpansion(snippet.id)}\n                style={{\n                  backgroundColor: \'#FFFFFF\',\n                  borderRadius: \'16px\',\n                  border: \'1.5px solid #F1F1F5\',\n                  padding: \'16px\',\n                  boxShadow: \'0 4px 12px rgba(117, 127, 233, 0.03)\',\n                  cursor: \'pointer\',\n                  animation: \'slideUpIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards\',\n                  animationDelay: `${index * 0.06}s`,\n                  opacity: 0, // setup for staggered load animation\n                  animationFillMode: \'forwards\',\n                  transition: \'border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s\',\n                  userSelect: \'none\',\n                  ...(isCopied && {\n                    animation: \'pulseSuccess 1.4s ease-out forwards\',\n                  })\n                }}\n              >\n                {/* Header Row */}\n                <div style={{ display: \'flex\', justifyContent: \'space-between\', alignItems: \'center\', marginBottom: \'8px\' }}>\n                  <div style={{ display: \'flex\', alignItems: \'center\', gap: \'8px\' }}>\n                    <span style={{ fontSize: \'18px\' }}>\n                      {getCategoryEmoji(snippet.category)}\n                    </span>\n                    <h3 style={{\n                      fontSize: \'16px\',\n                      fontWeight: \'700\',\n                      color: \'#1F2937\',\n                      margin: 0,\n                      lineHeight: \'1.2\'\n                    }}>\n                      {snippet.title}\n                    </h3>\n                  </div>\n                  <span style={{\n                    fontSize: \'11px\',\n                    fontWeight: \'700\',\n                    backgroundColor: \'rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.08)\',\n                    color: \'#FF4D3D\',\n                    padding: \'4px 8px\',\n                    borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                    letterSpacing: \'0.3px\',\n                    textTransform: \'uppercase\'\n                  }}>\n                    {snippet.category}\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Content body with Expand Trigger */}\n                <div style={{ marginBottom: \'14px\', position: \'relative\' }}>\n                  <p style={{\n                    fontSize: \'14px\',\n                    lineHeight: \'1.5\',\n                    color: \'#4B5563\',\n                    margin: 0,\n                    wordBreak: \'break-word\',\n                    fontFamily: \'\"Nunito Sans\", sans-serif\'\n                  }}>\n                    {isExpanded \n                      ? snippet.body \n                      : (snippet.body.length > 72 \n                          ? `${snippet.body.slice(0, 72)}...` \n                          : snippet.body)\n                    }\n                  </p>\n                  {snippet.body.length > 72 && !isExpanded && (\n                    <span style={{\n                      display: \'inline-block\',\n                      color: \'#9CA3AF\',\n                      fontSize: \'12px\',\n                      fontWeight: \'600\',\n                      marginTop: \'4px\'\n                    }}>\n                      Tap to expand\n                    </span>\n                  )}\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Card Action Buttons Row */}\n                <div style={{\n                  display: \'flex\',\n                  justifyContent: \'space-between\',\n                  alignItems: \'center\',\n                  borderTop: \'1px solid #F3F4F6\',\n                  paddingTop: \'12px\'\n                }}>\n                  <div style={{ display: \'flex\', gap: \'4px\' }}>\n                    {/* Edit button */}\n                    <button\n                      onClick={(e) => handleOpenEdit(e, snippet)}\n                      style={{\n                        padding: \'6px 12px\',\n                        backgroundColor: \'transparent\',\n                        border: \'none\',\n                        color: \'#4B5563\',\n                        fontSize: \'13px\',\n                        fontWeight: \'700\',\n                        borderRadius: \'8px\',\n                        cursor: \'pointer\',\n                        display: \'flex\',\n                        alignItems: \'center\',\n                        gap: \'4px\'\n                      }}\n                    >\n                      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 20h9\"></path>\n                        <path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z\"></path>\n                      </svg>\n                      Edit\n                    </button>\n\n                    {/* Delete button */}\n                    <button\n                      onClick={(e) => handleDelete(e, snippet.id)}\n                      style={{\n                        padding: \'6px 12px\',\n                        backgroundColor: \'transparent\',\n                        border: \'none\',\n                        color: \'#FF4D3D\',\n                        fontSize: \'13px\',\n                        fontWeight: \'700\',\n                        borderRadius: \'8px\',\n                        cursor: \'pointer\',\n                        display: \'flex\',\n                        alignItems: \'center\',\n                        gap: \'4px\'\n                      }}\n                    >\n                      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                        <polyline points=\"3 6 5 6 21 6\"></polyline>\n                        <path d=\"M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6m3 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path>\n                      </svg>\n                      Delete\n                    </button>\n                  </div>\n\n                  {/* Copy Button */}\n                  <button\n                    onClick={(e) => handleCopyText(e, snippet.id, snippet.body)}\n                    style={{\n                      padding: \'7px 14px\',\n                      backgroundColor: isCopied ? \'#10B981\' : \'#FF4D3D\',\n                      border: \'none\',\n                      color: \'#FFFFFF\',\n                      fontSize: \'13px\',\n                      fontWeight: \'700\',\n                      borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                      cursor: \'pointer\',\n                      display: \'flex\',\n                      alignItems: \'center\',\n                      gap: \'4px\',\n                      boxShadow: isCopied \n                        ? \'0 4px 10px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2)\' \n                        : \'0 4px 10px rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.2)\',\n                      transition: \'background-color 0.25s, transform 0.1s active\'\n                    }}\n                  >\n                    {isCopied ? (\n                      <>\n                        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"3\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                          <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline>\n                        </svg>\n                        Copied\n                      </>\n                    ) : (\n                      <>\n                        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2.5\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n                          <rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect>\n                          <path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path>\n                        </svg>\n                        Copy\n                      </>\n                    )}\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            );\n          })\n        ) : (\n          <div style={{\n            display: \'flex\',\n            flexDirection: \'column\',\n            alignItems: \'center\',\n            justifyContent: \'center\',\n            height: \'220px\',\n            color: \'#6B7280\',\n            gap: \'8px\'\n          }}>\n            <span style={{ fontSize: \'32px\' }}>\360\237\224\215</span>\n            <p style={{ margin: 0, fontWeight: \'700\', fontSize: \'15px\' }}>No matches found</p>\n            <p style={{ margin: 0, fontSize: \'13px\', color: \'#9CA3AF\' }}>Try adjusting your search criteria</p>\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 4. TOAST NOTIFICATION (Positional anchor right above FAB) */}\n      <div style={{\n        position: \'absolute\',\n        bottom: \'96px\',\n        left: \'16px\',\n        right: \'16px\',\n        backgroundColor: \'#1F2937\',\n        color: \'#FFFFFF\',\n        borderRadius: \'12px\',\n        padding: \'12px 16px\',\n        boxShadow: \'0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)\',\n        display: \'flex\',\n        alignItems: \'center\',\n        gap: \'10px\',\n        zIndex: 40,\n        pointerEvents: \'none\',\n        transform: toast.visible ? \'translateY(0)\' : \'translateY(40px)\',\n        opacity: toast.visible ? 1 : 0,\n        transition: \'transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), opacity 0.3s ease\'\n      }}>\n        <div style={{\n          width: \'6px\',\n          height: \'6px\',\n          borderRadius: \'50%\',\n          backgroundColor: \'#FF4D3D\'\n        }} />\n        <span style={{ fontSize: \'13px\', fontWeight: \'700\' }}>\n          {toast.message}\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 5. FLOATING ACTION BUTTON (FAB) */}\n      <button\n        onClick={handleOpenAdd}\n        style={{\n          position: \'absolute\',\n          bottom: \'24px\',\n          right: \'24px\',\n          width: \'56px\',\n          height: \'56px\',\n          borderRadius: \'50%\',\n          backgroundColor: \'#FF4D3D\',\n          border: \'none\',\n          color: \'#FFFFFF\',\n          display: \'flex\',\n          alignItems: \'center\',\n          justifyContent: \'center\',\n          boxShadow: \'0 8px 18px rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.35)\',\n          cursor: \'pointer\',\n          zIndex: 30,\n          transition: \'transform 0.15s ease\'\n        }}\n        onMouseDown={(e) => e.currentTarget.style.transform = \'scale(0.92)\'}\n        onMouseUp={(e) => e.currentTarget.style.transform = \'scale(1)\'}\n        onTouchStart={(e) => e.currentTarget.style.transform = \'scale(0.92)\'}\n        onTouchEnd={(e) => e.currentTarget.style.transform = \'scale(1)\'}\n      >\n        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"3\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"></line>\n          <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line>\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n\n      {/* 6. BOTTOM SHEET BACKDROP & OVERLAY */}\n      <div \n        onClick={() => setIsBottomSheetOpen(false)}\n        style={{\n          position: \'absolute\',\n          top: 0,\n          left: 0,\n          right: 0,\n          bottom: 0,\n          backgroundColor: \'rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45)\',\n          backdropFilter: \'blur(3px)\',\n          zIndex: 50,\n          pointerEvents: isBottomSheetOpen ? \'auto\' : \'none\',\n          opacity: isBottomSheetOpen ? 1 : 0,\n          transition: \'opacity 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)\'\n        }}\n      />\n\n      {/* 7. BOTTOM SHEET ELEMENT */}\n      <div style={{\n        position: \'absolute\',\n        bottom: 0,\n        left: 0,\n        right: 0,\n        backgroundColor: \'#FFFFFF\',\n        borderTopLeftRadius: \'24px\',\n        borderTopRightRadius: \'24px\',\n        padding: \'8px 20px 24px 20px\',\n        zIndex: 60,\n        boxShadow: \'0 -10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)\',\n        transform: isBottomSheetOpen ? \'translateY(0)\' : \'translateY(100%)\',\n        transition: \'transform 0.32s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)\',\n        display: \'flex\',\n        flexDirection: \'column\'\n      }}>\n        {/* Top Drag Handle Bar */}\n        <div style={{\n          width: \'36px\',\n          height: \'5px\',\n          backgroundColor: \'#E5E7EB\',\n          borderRadius: \'100px\',\n          margin: \'0 auto 16px auto\',\n          cursor: \'pointer\'\n        }} onClick={() => setIsBottomSheetOpen(false)} />\n\n        <div style={{ display: \'flex\', justifyContent: \'space-between\', alignItems: \'center\', marginBottom: \'18px\' }}>\n          <h2 style={{\n            fontSize: \'18px\',\n            fontWeight: \'800\',\n            color: \'#1F2937\',\n            margin: 0\n          }}>\n            {editingSnippet ? \'Edit Snippet\' : \'New Snippet\'}\n          </h2>\n          <button\n            onClick={() => setIsBottomSheetOpen(false)}\n            style={{\n              background: \'#F3F4F6\',\n              border: \'none\',\n              borderRadius: \'50%\',\n              width: \'28px\',\n              height: \'28px\',\n              display: \'flex\',\n              alignItems: \'center\',\n              justifyContent: \'center\',\n              cursor: \'pointer\',\n              color: \'#4B5563\'\n            }}\n          >\n            <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"3\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n              <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n              <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <form onSubmit={handleSave} style={{ display: \'flex\', flexDirection: \'column\', gap: \'14px\' }}>\n          {/* Title Input */}\n          <div style={{ display: \'flex\', flexDirection: \'column\', gap: \'6px\' }}>\n            <label style={{ fontSize: \'13px\', fontWeight: \'700\', color: \'#4B5563\' }}>Snippet Title</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"text\"\n              required\n              placeholder=\"e.g. Return Policy Overview\"\n              value={formTitle}\n              onChange={(e) => setFormTitle(e.target.value)}\n              style={{\n                padding: \'12px\',\n                borderRadius: \'12px\',\n                border: \'1.5px solid #E5E7EB\',\n                fontSize: \'15px\',\n                fontFamily: \'inherit\',\n                color: \'#1F2937\',\n                width: \'100%\',\n                boxSizing: \'border-box\'\n              }}\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Category Selector Pills inside form */}\n          <div style={{ display: \'flex\', flexDirection: \'column\', gap: \'8px\' }}>\n            <label style={{ fontSize: \'13px\', fontWeight: \'700\', color: \'#4B5563\' }}>Category</label>\n            <div style={{ display: \'flex\', gap: \'8px\', flexWrap: \'wrap\' }}>\n              {CATEGORIES.slice(1).map((category) => {\n                const isSelected = formCategory === category;\n                return (\n                  <button\n                    key={category}\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    onClick={() => setFormCategory(category)}\n                    style={{\n                      padding: \'8px 14px\',\n                      borderRadius: \'100px\',\n                      border: \'1.5px solid\',\n                      borderColor: isSelected ? \'#FF4D3D\' : \'#E5E7EB\',\n                      backgroundColor: isSelected ? \'#FF4D3D\' : \'transparent\',\n                      color: isSelected ? \'#FFFFFF\' : \'#4B5563\',\n                      fontWeight: \'700\',\n                      fontSize: \'13px\',\n                      cursor: \'pointer\',\n                      transition: \'all 0.15s ease\'\n                    }}\n                  >\n                    {getCategoryEmoji(category)} {category}\n                  </button>\n                );\n              })}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Body Textarea */}\n          <div style={{ display: \'flex\', flexDirection: \'column\', gap: \'6px\' }}>\n            <label style={{ fontSize: \'13px\', fontWeight: \'700\', color: \'#4B5563\' }}>Message Text</label>\n            <textarea\n              required\n              rows={4}\n              placeholder=\"Paste or write the response sent to customers...\"\n              value={formBody}\n              onChange={(e) => setFormBody(e.target.value)}\n              style={{\n                padding: \'12px\',\n                borderRadius: \'12px\',\n                border: \'1.5px solid #E5E7EB\',\n                fontSize: \'15px\',\n                fontFamily: \'inherit\',\n                color: \'#1F2937\',\n                width: \'100%\',\n                boxSizing: \'border-box\',\n                resize: \'none\',\n                lineHeight: \'1.4\'\n              }}\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Save Action Button */}\n          <button\n            type=\"submit\"\n            disabled={!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()}\n            style={{\n              marginTop: \'8px\',\n              padding: \'14px\',\n              borderRadius: \'14px\',\n              border: \'none\',\n              backgroundColor: (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) ? \'#F3F4F6\' : \'#FF4D3D\',\n              color: (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) ? \'#9CA3AF\' : \'#FFFFFF\',\n              fontWeight: \'800\',\n              fontSize: \'15px\',\n              cursor: (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) ? \'not-allowed\' : \'pointer\',\n              display: \'flex\',\n              alignItems: \'center\',\n              justifyContent: \'center\',\n              gap: \'6px\',\n              boxShadow: (!formTitle.trim() || !formBody.trim()) ? \'none\' : \'0 6px 16px rgba(255, 77, 61, 0.25)\',\n              transition: \'background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s\'\n            }}\n          >\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"3\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\">\n              <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline>\n            </svg>\n            Save Snippet\n          </button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Key Technical Aspects Included:\n*   **iOS Native Feel:** Integrates styled battery, signals, wifi, and clock displays inside a mocked native-sized layout [1].\n*   **Interactive Search & Filter:** Dynamically updates category tag count badges inline based on total occurrences [1].\n*   **Micro-Animations:** Pure JSX-friendly custom CSS is injected to support staggered load slide-ins, backdrop overlays, slide-up panels, and card background flashes on copy actions [1].\n*   **SSR Compatibility:** The simulated system clock is mounted via Client Component standard cycles to avoid Next.js hydration anomalies [1]."
    }
  }
}
