h the design spec. I\'m also ensuring the styling is consistent with the rest of the UI.\n\n\n**Refining Card Styles**\n\nI\'m now refining the visual styles for the cards, with a focus on click behavior and expanded states. I\'m ensuring smooth animations, like staggered loading and a pulse animation for copied snippets, for enhanced user feedback. I\'m also ensuring the styling is responsive and accessible. I\'m optimizing click handlers and transition effects to enhance card interactions.\n\n\n**Adjusting Snippet Displays**\n\nI\'m now integrating the snippet displays, specifically focusing on the header row with the category emoji and title. I\'m adapting the styling for the title and the category emoji, also the font sizing. I\'m focusing on the component\'s structure and its visual representation within the application.\n\n\n**Enhancing Card Interactions**\n\nI\'m now integrating the expand/collapse functionality for each snippet card, along with styling. I\'m focusing on the component\'s conditional rendering based on `isExpanded` state and adjusting the body text\'s display, to show either the full or truncated content. I\'m focusing on both visual feedback and improved accessibility, ensuring the expanded and collapsed states are clear. I\'m also ensuring the correct font, spacing and design are applied as requested.\n\n\n**Finalizing Search and Filtering**\n\nI\'m now integrating the search and filter functions. Specifically, I\'m ensuring smooth UI updates and responsiveness for both. I\'m focusing on user interactions and making sure the UI correctly reflects the applied search query and filter criteria. The goal is to provide intuitive and effective control over the displayed snippets.\n\n\n**Refining Icon Interactions**\n\nI\'m now integrating the edit and delete icons within the card component, focusing on the click handlers and visual styling. I\'ve ensured these are correctly incorporated within the component\'s structure for improved interactions a