the `z-index` are correct. I\'m also ensuring the backdrop covers the screen and responds correctly to the `isBottomSheetOpen` state.\n\n\n**Refining Bottom Sheet Styles**\n\nI\'m now integrating the styles for the bottom sheet content, and focusing on the drag handle bar to close the sheet. I\'m ensuring all elements are responsive and visually consistent. I\'m also now linking the backdrop element\'s state to the `isBottomSheetOpen` state.\n\n\n**Finalizing Close Button**\n\nI\'m now integrating the close button into the bottom sheet. I\'m focusing on responsiveness and visual styling to ensure it\'s easily visible and clickable. I\'m also ensuring the click handler correctly closes the bottom sheet.\n\nI\'ve integrated the close button with the correct visual styling. I\'m focused on the responsiveness of the button, and the close button\'s click handler. I\'m also making sure the color and icon styling meets the design spec.\n\n\n**Adjusting Form Interactions**\n\nI\'m now integrating the form components within the bottom sheet for adding or editing snippets. I\'m focusing on the input field and category selector interaction, along with the title input. The category selector buttons are being handled. The focus is to allow seamless transitions and interactions within the form.\n\n\n**Refining Form Submission**\n\nI\'m now refining form submission, ensuring the category selector updates correctly on form submission. I\'m focusing on ensuring the styling, interaction, and responsiveness of the button, and also all form interaction, is working correctly.\n\nI\'m now ensuring the `handleSave` function is correctly updating the category state when a form is saved. The goal is now to ensure UI feedback and state updates are working together.\n\n\n**Styling Form Textarea**\n\nI\'m now styling the form\'s text area for the message text, including padding, border, font size, and color, along with ensuring it resizes and fits within the bottom sheet. I\'m focusing on responsiveness and user interaction, ensuring it looks good and is easily usable, and correctly linked to the states.\n\n\n**Refining Form Button**\n\nI\'m now integrating the form button styles, incorporating the visual design for active and disabled states. I\'m focusing on responsiveness and user experience for the \"Save Snippet\" button, and ensuring it visually changes to indicate when it\'s clickable. The `disabled` state handling is key.\n\nI am now focusing on the visual styling for the form save button. I\'m integrating the visual styles for the active and disabled states. This also includes the hover and active states. I am ensuring that styling correctly reflects when input is disabled. I\'m making sure responsiveness is maintained.\n\n\n"
