  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have updated the application to support individual snippet sharing while preserving the bulk data backup functionality! \n\n- **Individual Snippet Sharing**: Added a new \"Share\" button to the footer of every snippet card. Clicking this button generates a unique link containing only that specific snippet and its category, and copies it to your clipboard.\n- **Seamless Loading**: Whenever someone visits that snippet link, they\'ll instantly import only that specific message and category into their own local collection without overwriting their existing entries.\n\nYou can now use the Settings menu to back up your whole library, and use the card buttons to share responses one at a time."
